  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large Dutch oven, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the lamb shoulder and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the kaffir lime leaves, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the Dutch oven and transfer to the preheated oven.",
    "Roast the lamb for 2 1/2 hours, or until tender and falling apart.",
    "Remove the Dutch oven from the oven and let it cool slightly.",
    "Serve the lamb hot, garnished with fresh herbs and accompanied by crusty bread or couscous."
